menuconfig MODULES_FLIP_RIG_PITCH_ATT
	bool "flip_rig_pitch_att"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for flip_rig_pitch_att

		Standalone, manually-started single-shot 360 degree pitch flip
		controller for a fixture that physically prevents translation
		(e.g. a 3-axis gimbal/gyroscope test rig), driven through the
		ATTITUDE setpoint path (mc_att_control) instead of raw body
		rates. Never touches position/GPS - start with
		`flip_rig_pitch_att start` and do not run it alongside another
		OFFBOARD-publishing module. The instant OFFBOARD is engaged, it
		latches the vehicle's current yaw, executes exactly one 360
		degree pitch rotation by chasing a continuously-advancing
		attitude setpoint, then commands a level attitude at the
		latched yaw and holds it.
